            "review_title": "Review at Picante Latino- Gusto Latino Gourmet",
            "review_text": "Omnivore17\nNha Trang, Vietnam15 contributions\n2\nThey closed and reopened up the street\nJul 2018 • Solo\nPicante is now Gusto Latino. It's on the same street but if you are standing in front of the original one looking at the front door, it's about a quarter mile to your right, near (but not quite to) O'Douceurs Bakery Cafe. \n\nThe original Picante has unfortunately closed. Probably too expensive for this area (country? tour group?). Too bad. But this reincarnation is much cheaper with an emphasis on Mexican food (burritos, tacos, etc.) rather than Peruvian. They do have a ceviche bar but I don't know how long that will last.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 26, 2018",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
