            "review_title": "Review at Picante Latino- Gusto Latino Gourmet",
            "review_text": "titilt\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nGreat peruvian restaurant\nJun 2017 • Couples\nI have been here a couple of time and really enjoyed it.\n\nFood is really good (the ceviche is excellent), service is good too.\n\nPrice is a bit expensive compared to other latino restaurant you find around, but I think it's worth it as the food is better. \n\nEach time I've been there it was almost empty, I think it's a shame and deserve to get more attention\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 27, 2017",
