            "review_title": "Review at Picante Latino- Gusto Latino Gourmet",
            "review_text": "Lee_N_76\nEindhoven, The Netherlands309 contributions\n0\nSuperb foods, excellent service and lovely view\nMay 2017 • Friends\nThe restaurant is on the third floor and the entrance is kind of small, just a staircase. It is a bit hard to find but is totally worth it. I've heard of Peruvian cuisine so we looked up the location beforehand but I wouldn't be surprise if most people missed it. The atmosphere and the Latino music were relaxing, but the best of all is the lovely view looking out to the lake. The staffs were friendly and prompt, attentive without turning into annoying. The foods were simply amazing that we asked for the chef to compliment him, a very nice Peruvian guy from Lima. The price wasn't cheap but I would say is fair for what we got. I came with friends but I reckon this is a perfect place for a romantic dinner. Definitely will come again\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 20, 2017",
            "rating": 4.0,
